Flavio Bolsonaro are virtually tied.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Who are the women powering India's youth-led 'Cockroach' protests?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3da31fa191a405f5f6230934cd78205043c28f471a2e26092727c3067316b3d7</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:35Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T15:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/who-are-the-women-powering-india-s-youth-led-cockroach-protests/a-79709824--e78a361757e3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/who-are-the-women-powering-india-s-youth-led-cockroach-protests/a-79709824?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Facing online harassment and police detentions, women are taking to the streets of Indian cities in large numbers for the youth-led "Cockroach" protests. Amid a large-scale crackdown, they refuse to be seen as victims.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Wagner brothers begin new NBA chapter on different paths</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:80888242ae796f3e10206b69ff8154c4dbcbf171fb5bdd888bc4270d751ca28e</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:35Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T12:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/wagner-brothers-begin-new-nba-chapter-on-different-paths/a-79712668--ff5544415c4f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/wagner-brothers-begin-new-nba-chapter-on-different-paths/a-79712668?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After five years, brothers Franz and Moritz Wagner are no longer playing together for the Orlando Magic. In the new NBA season, their separation will likely mean the new "German" team is the Charlotte Hornets.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Germany: Google must have consent to publish property images</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9fe7d4d61874849fdfe83525a1ea835cd1d7497b5718ad9981cad666b7bd0dfa</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:35Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T11:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-google-must-have-consent-to-publish-property-images/a-79712552--7cfbdb603d27.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-google-must-have-consent-to-publish-property-images/a-79712552?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A court in the western German state of Hesse has said Google is "spying" on people and has no right to publish information about their property on its Maps and Earth sites. The case stems from images taken from the air.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Why US investors are snapping up Germany's famed Mittelstand</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:763fc001284c2a46fb2632a50bdfef322e09ea2c38ca834136e00ad70263be68</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:35Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T09:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-us-investors-are-snapping-up-germany-s-famed-mittelstand/a-79705421--453454d6f76c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-us-investors-are-snapping-up-germany-s-famed-mittelstand/a-79705421?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Increasing amounts of US capital are flowing into Germany's traditional industrial firms and family-owned businesses. As many business owners struggle to find successors, more companies are becoming acquisition targets.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Brutal, revolutionary empire builder: Genghis Khan's legacy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:95f8adc784ec9c31fae8a346c5ab4c565696a9449fc7182686b119efd3c44360</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:35Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T08:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/brutal-revolutionary-empire-builder-genghis-khan-s-legacy/a-79697112--675146225486.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/brutal-revolutionary-empire-builder-genghis-khan-s-legacy/a-79697112?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Berlin is host to a major exhibition on the founder of the Mongol Empire and his successors. Here's how Genghis Khan disrupted the course of history.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Japan probe sets course for Mars moon</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:88d1890c533eb387547a16ba869e210e92338041f832957c63d3be240e6cb640</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:35Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T07:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/japan-probe-sets-course-for-mars-moon/a-79708491--8ca3c6616a26.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/japan-probe-sets-course-for-mars-moon/a-79708491?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The MMX spacecraft is on its way to Mars' moon Phobos to collect surface samples that could help answer long-standing questions about the formation of the Solar System.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Rubio holds talks with counterpart Jaishankar</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:241972247ffda2e47d56e7b06a708a009499a03fc8dc19a4a967781119620099</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:35Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T06:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-rubio-holds-talks-with-counterpart-jaishankar/live-79708492--c711a58d8b65.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-rubio-holds-talks-with-counterpart-jaishankar/live-79708492?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Marco Rubio's talks with Indian Foreign Minister Jaishankar come as the two countries struggle to finalize a trade deal.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
